# Do not start a local server

A local web server is already running via an editor plugin. Never start another one.

Do not run commands such as:

- `python -m http.server`
- `npx serve` / `npx http-server` / `npx live-server`
- `vite` / `npm run dev` / `npm start` used only to preview static HTML
- any other ad-hoc local file server

For browser verification, use the already running plugin server. Do not spawn a new process to host the site.
